      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The Annona squamosa L. bark was collected from Ahmednagar district, India. 18-Acetoxy-ent-kaur-16-ene was isolated from petroleum ether extract (PE) and studied for its analgesic and anti-inflammatory activities. 18-Acetoxy-ent-kaur-16-ene at the doses of 12.5 and 25 mg/kg, and PE at a dose of 50 mg/kg exhibited significant analgesic along with anti-inflammatory activity."},
